hrm{SigmaCenteredPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaCenteredPoset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"130f2eb9510d97cd\" href=\"?note=130f2eb9510d97cd\" title=\"58-df-finite-subset.md\">58-df-finite-subset.md</a> 的有限子集记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}centered\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaCenteredPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathbb P=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall F\\in[A(n)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}centered\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaCenteredPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\exists A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)^\\omega\\;\\left(\\mathbb P=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A(n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall F\\in[A(n)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb P\\;\\forall p\\in F\\;(\\langle r,p\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target"